The robot's primitive geometry and project source were authored for this project.
No Jumper or Microduck source, meshes, CAD or policy weights are bundled.

Architecture references (not vendored):
  KingKongRobotics/jumper: software/simulation/deployment separation.
  pollen-robotics/microduck and microduck_rl: shared policy contracts and
  actuator calibration as a first-class sim-to-real concern.

Runtime dependencies are separate distributions under their own licenses.
In particular, mjlab, MuJoCo and MuJoCo Warp use Apache-2.0; rsl_rl uses
BSD-3-Clause. See installed distribution license files for the complete terms.
